# SHA-256 of the ocrs models embedded by the `bundle-models` feature.
# build.rs and CI (.github/actions/ocr-models) refuse any other bytes.
# Source: https://ocrs-models.s3-accelerate.amazonaws.com/<file>
# Unpinned entries ("unknown") fail the build and print the downloaded digest.
unknown  text-detection.onnx
unknown  text-recognition.onnx
